REPORT-ACCOUNTS

The owner-only cleanup refused: the digest of the address the owner gave matched no
account in production. The guard did its job and nothing was removed, but it leaves a
question that guessing is the wrong way to answer — which accounts are these?

This asks for a read-only description. Addresses are masked, because this repository is
public and so are its job logs; the digest of each is printed in full, which discloses
nothing on its own and lets the owner identify an account exactly by hashing a
candidate address.

Remove this file once the report has run.
